---
title: "Contact — Nocturea"
description: "Three questions — the project, the deadline, the budget — and a written reply within two working days from the person who would do the work."
active: contact
---
<section class="noc-wrap noc-section--hero">
  <p class="noc-eyebrow noc-eyebrow--head">Contact</p>
  <h1 class="noc-h1">Three questions. Then a written answer.</h1>
  <p class="noc-lead noc-hero-lead">The project, the deadline, the budget. Replies come within two working days, from the person who would do the work.</p>
</section>

<section class="noc-wrap noc-contact">
  <form class="noc-form" method="POST" action="https://formspree.io/f/xgojappg">
    <div class="noc-grid-2">
      <div class="noc-field">
        <label for="noc-name">Name</label>
        <input id="noc-name" type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name or handle" />
      </div>
      <div class="noc-field">
        <label for="noc-email">Email</label>
        <input id="noc-email" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="noc-field">
      <label for="noc-project">The project</label>
      <textarea id="noc-project" name="project" required rows="5" placeholder="What you are building, and what it needs to do."></textarea>
    </div>

    <div class="noc-grid-2">
      <div class="noc-field">
        <label for="noc-deadline">Deadline</label>
        <select id="noc-deadline" name="deadline" required>
          <option value="">Select</option>
          <option>No fixed date</option>
          <option>Within a month</option>
          <option>One to three months</option>
          <option>Later this year</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="noc-field">
        <label for="noc-budget">Budget</label>
        <select id="noc-budget" name="budget" required>
          <option value="">Select</option>
          <option>600 – 1 500 €</option>
          <option>1 500 – 3 000 €</option>
          <option>3 000 – 6 000 €</option>
          <option>Over 6 000 €</option>
          <option>Not decided yet</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="noc-form__foot">
      <span class="noc-form__note">Your details are used to reply and nothing else.</span>
      <button type="submit" class="noc-btn noc-btn--primary noc-btn--lg">Send</button>
    </div>
  </form>

  <aside class="noc-aside">
    <div>
      <span class="noc-kicker noc-aside__head">Availability</span>
      <p>Two project slots open this autumn. Identities from 600 €, websites from 1 500 €.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="noc-kicker noc-aside__head">What happens next</span>
      <div class="noc-list">
        <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">01</span>A written reply within two working days.</div>
        <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">02</span>A call if the project is a fit, not before.</div>
        <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">03</span>A fixed quote and a start date.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="noc-kicker noc-aside__head">Elsewhere</span>
      <a href="/work.html">See the work first →</a>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>
